, "type": "string"}, "datatype": "url"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q15985$7F48E86B-21AE-49F7-8834-ABFB37252550", "rank": "normal"}], "P21": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P21", "hash": "69742704c5f2353509ada363939718854c183e7f", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type": "item", "numeric-id": 1771, "id": "Q1771"}, "type": "wikibase-entityid"}, "datatype": "wikibase-item"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q15985$29AB3C08-267E-4512-9A7C-ADE2537D448D", "rank": "normal"}, {"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P21", "hash": "9bf592b12a06f330268845dbe30a8392a31b43e8", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type": "item", "numeric-id": 361, "id": "Q361"}, "type": "wikibase-entityid"}, "datatype": "wikibase-item"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q15985$CB76901B-EE43-41FE-9689-1279A461996C", "rank": "normal"}, {"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P21", "hash": "c77606455e25517eab4336b9b4c69882c7c3655b", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type": "item", "numeric-id": 469, "id": "Q469"}, "type": "wikibase-entityid"}, "datatype": "wikibase-item"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q15985$1A2FD090-4493-4A09-B35F-00A547AED5FC", "rank": "normal"}], "P22": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P22", "hash": "8e0abffddec0903ecca01af48d389b0fbf3384ab", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type": "item", "numeric-id": 1772, "id": "Q1772"}, "type": "wikibase-entityid"}, "datatype": "wikibase-item"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q15985$F00DD9A2-54D9-4094-980F-D5E50EB882E9", "rank": "normal"}], "P23": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P23", "hash": "25176b513f2f538153e5cdca588409932451f34f", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type": "item", "numeric-id": 1772, "id": "Q1772"}, "type": "wikibase-entityid"}, "datatype": "wikibase-item"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q15985$1813B382-AB64-4124-B314-F36650E7106D", "rank": "normal"}], "P19": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P19", "hash": "11678e1f7028fb6ce6a9eadfc0c674b763daeda8", "datavalue": {"value": "Yeah, in Paris. Oh yeah. We found a place that was a restaurant. Downstairs they had a bar, a room that they didn't use anymore, but it had a piano. We used to go there.The waiters knew us all. We would congregate in this room, sometimes just a pianist and myself. That was wonderful. My ears were wide open. Oh, and I want to tell you about when I was in Paris and Klook and me had a band. It was...", "type": "string"}, "datatype": "string"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q15985$5B803B00-CD80-4A25-BB88-93980A545164", "rank": "normal"}]}}